<view class="container">
  <!--<view class="header"><text class="title">mPaaS JSAPI 代理</text></view> -->

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title flex-row justify-between">
      <view>
        设备与状态
      </view>
      <view class="card-title-desc" onTap="showUsage">使用说明</view>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row">
      <text class="label">设备ID：</text>
      <text class="value">{{deviceId}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="info-row divider">
      <text class="label">状态：</text>
      <text class="status {{statusClass}}">{{connectionStatus}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">服务器配置</view>
    <view class="input-row-scan">
      <input
        class="server-input"
        placeholder="ws://192.168.1.100:3000"
        value="{{serverUrl}}"
        onInput="onServerUrlInput"
      />
      <image class="scan-icon" src="{{scanIcon}}" onTap="scanQRCode" />
    </view>
    <view class="button-row">
      <button a:if="{{!isConnected}}" class="btn-primary" onTap="connect">连接</button>
      <button a:if="{{isConnected}}" class="btn-secondary" onTap="disconnect">
        断开
      </button>
      <button class="btn-secondary" onTap="copyConnectionParams">复制连接参数</button>
    </view>

  </view>

  <view class="card flex-1 h-1">
    <view class="card-title">运行日志</view>
    <view class="button-row log-actions">
      <button class="btn-mini" onTap="copyLogs">复制</button>
      <button class="btn-mini" onTap="clearLogs">清空</button>
    </view>
    <view class="log-list flex-1 h-1">
      <view a:for="{{logs}}" class="log-item" a:key="id">
        <view class="flex-row justify-between">
          <view>
            <text class="log-time">{{item.time}}</text>
            <text class="log-tag">{{item.tag}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="log-copy" onTap="copyLog" data-log="{{item}}">
            复制
          </view>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text class="log-text">{{item.text}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view a:if="{{!logs.length}}" class="log-empty">
        <text class="hint-text">暂无日志</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view a:if="{{showUsage}}" class="popup-mask" onTap="hideUsage">
    <view class="popup" catchTap="stopBubble">
      <view class="popup-header">
        <text class="popup-title">使用说明</text>
        <text class="popup-close" onTap="hideUsage">×</text>
      </view>
      <view class="popup-body">
        <view class="section-label">1. 启动代理服务器（电脑）</view>
        <view class="code-block" onTap="copyInstallCommand">
          <text class="code-text">
            npm install -g mpaas-jsapi-proxy && mpaas-jsapi-proxy
          </text>
          <image class="copy-icon" src="/assets/copy.svg" />
        </view>

        <view class="section-label">2. 模拟器项目安装（电脑）</view>
        <view class="code-block" onTap="copyClientInstall">
          <text class="code-text">npm install mpaas-jsapi-proxy --save</text>
          <image class="copy-icon" src="/assets/copy.svg" />
        </view>

        <view class="section-label">3. 模拟器 app.js 接入（点击复制，已填入本页参数）</view>
        <view class="code-block" onTap="copyClientUsage">
          <text class="code-text">{{clientUsageSnippet}}</text>
          <image class="copy-icon" src="/assets/copy.svg" />
        </view>

        <view class="section-label">蓝牙代理模式（只把蓝牙 API 转发到真机）</view>
        <view class="code-block" onTap="copyBluetoothSnippet">
          <text class="code-text">{{bluetoothSnippet}}</text>
          <image class="copy-icon" src="/assets/copy.svg" />
        </view>

        <view class="section-label">说明</view>
        <text class="hint-text">
          默认模式：连接后所有 my.call 走真机；bluetooth 模式：仅蓝牙 API 走真机（含事件多播），其余保持模拟器本地执行。本页设备ID需与模拟器接入参数一致。
        </text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>